msgctxt "Languages::kwtsms.help.cron.host_p1"
msgid "On PHP-FPM and LiteSpeed servers, order SMS go out right after the shopper's page is sent. On other servers (for example Apache with mod_php), order SMS wait in the queue for the cron while it runs every minute, so the checkout never waits for kwtSMS. If the cron does not run, they are sent during the checkout, which makes it slower."
